{
  "text": " Your blood is an organism. Hundreds of millions of years ago, a tubular organism swallowed through the blood of a dear man. A soft, fragile creature. Its strength was that it had a massively increased surface area on which to digest food. Its weakness was that it was hard to be consumed. At some point, one of these was ingested. It combined and somehow merged with another organism that had a harder casein, but was limited by this casein and its smaller surface area as to how much food it could consume. And so, the two combined their strength and made their way better than either could have done in the video. Evolving and mutating to this very day. That alien creature still lives within you. Perhaps you can feel it now. It has more neurotransmitters and is older than your brain. It is wise, ancient, and most of all, it wants to live. While you are dreaming, indulging in grandiose fantasies of love, prosperity, fame, your gut is right there at the core face, processing the outside world in a very intimate fashion. You, you, your feet barely touch the ground, living in abstract realms as a disembodied intellect. You, you, your feet barely touch the ground, you",
